From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:03:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/29] Mobile: Make the shopping list screens faster

Tiles are memoized and only re-render when their item changes; changes
to other lists no longer reload the open one; sync status updates are
batched; taps and new items update the screen immediately. A warm-up
shortly after app start opens the lists database, builds the catalog
index and primes the signing code, so the first use is no longer slow.
Member names now also travel over Bluetooth. Timing entries in the test
log; the Bluetooth manager tests no longer depend on sleeps.

